{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of building and managing your own ski resort? <strong>Planet Ski\u2122</strong> brings that dream to life. Every detail \u2014 every lift, every slope, every tree \u2014 counts. Make it uniquely yours, or recreate the magic of a real-world resort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893520/extras/2966fde2e771db150db6248af40cf75d.avif?t=1758400947\" width=800 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's included in the demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Planet Ski\u2122 Demo</strong> is a limited version of the full game that lets you experience the core building and management mechanics. In this demo, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access a few lifts, featuring several common lift types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on a few maps (not scaled 1:1).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resort\u2019s economy system and <strong>balance skier happiness</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save and load as many resorts as you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox</strong> &amp; <strong>Economy</strong> gamemodes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo contains the core experience of Planet Ski\u2122, but without the extended content and advanced features of the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's in the full game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>full version</strong> of Planet Ski\u2122 includes everything in the demo <strong>as well as</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Larger map sizes</strong>, including <strong>1:1 scale maps</strong> for realistic resorts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>wider variety of maps</strong> to explore and build on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional content, including <strong>Lift Expansion Pack DLCs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many <strong>extra gameplay features</strong>, such as <strong>Ski Schools, Ski Patrol</strong>, and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modding support</strong> and <strong>Steam Workshop integration</strong> for community content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >User generated <strong>scenarios</strong> + <strong>buildin scenarios</strong>, and other gamemodes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893520/extras/e1ae2a335ec0184e0f94c686483489d2.avif?t=1758400947\" width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins with you and the mountain. You notice the rocks, the trees, the shape of the terrain that makes this mountain special. You start small, with your very first lift \u2014 it\u2019s simple, maybe a bit slow. But soon, you expand: a surface lift here, a T-bar there. Eventually, you save up enough for that amazing fixed-grip chairlift you\u2019ve been dreaming about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your resort grows and evolves. More lifts, more slopes, more happy skiers carving through perfect snow. It feels like heaven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then, when your resort is complete \u2014 when every line, every run, and every turn is just right \u2014 you hit <strong>New Game</strong>\u2026 and the journey begins all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P.S.:</strong> Planet Ski\u2122 is still in early development \u2014 screenshots and content will be updated as the game grows!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3893520?t=1758400947","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3893520?t=1758400947","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893520/394897036b965127a19936d3aa73c516bcd54983/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758400947","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893520/394897036b965127a19936d3aa73c516bcd54983/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758400947","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of building and managing your own ski resort? <strong>Planet Ski\u2122</strong> brings that dream to life. Every detail \u2014 every lift, every slope, every tree \u2014 counts. Make it uniquely yours, or recreate the magic of a real-world resort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893520/extras/2966fde2e771db150db6248af40cf75d.avif?t=1758400947\" width=800 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's included in the demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Planet Ski\u2122 Demo</strong> is a limited version of the full game that lets you experience the core building and management mechanics. In this demo, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access a few lifts, featuring several common lift types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on a few maps (not scaled 1:1).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resort\u2019s economy system and <strong>balance skier happiness</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save and load as many resorts as you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox</strong> &amp; <strong>Economy</strong> gamemodes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo contains the core experience of Planet Ski\u2122, but without the extended content and advanced features of the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's in the full game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>full version</strong> of Planet Ski\u2122 includes everything in the demo <strong>as well as</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Larger map sizes</strong>, including <strong>1:1 scale maps</strong> for realistic resorts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>wider variety of maps</strong> to explore and build on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional content, including <strong>Lift Expansion Pack DLCs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many <strong>extra gameplay features</strong>, such as <strong>Ski Schools, Ski Patrol</strong>, and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modding support</strong> and <strong>Steam Workshop integration</strong> for community content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >User generated <strong>scenarios</strong> + <strong>buildin scenarios</strong>, and other gamemodes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893520/extras/e1ae2a335ec0184e0f94c686483489d2.avif?t=1758400947\" width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins with you and the mountain. You notice the rocks, the trees, the shape of the terrain that makes this mountain special. You start small, with your very first lift \u2014 it\u2019s simple, maybe a bit slow. But soon, you expand: a surface lift here, a T-bar there. Eventually, you save up enough for that amazing fixed-grip chairlift you\u2019ve been dreaming about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your resort grows and evolves. More lifts, more slopes, more happy skiers carving through perfect snow. It feels like heaven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then, when your resort is complete \u2014 when every line, every run, and every turn is just right \u2014 you hit <strong>New Game</strong>\u2026 and the journey begins all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P.S.:</strong> Planet Ski\u2122 is still in early development \u2014 screenshots and content will be updated as the game grows!</p>","developers":["Gaupestudio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3882920","name":"Planet Ski"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893520/6065122f394555f9be3d1d3a6aff4c4cea71dc9e/header.jpg?t=1758400947","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Planet Ski: Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound card</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>